   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>What is the convention for publishing to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360766916000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xQl_uGmTebagfzibJggyW\">shinyapps.io</a> using a postgres db?  Below is the code currently.  App works fine locally and publishes when post to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360766916000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xQl_uGmTebagfzibJggyW\">shinyapps.io</a> via csv datasource, but when uncomment the csv part, the error returned is:</div><div><br></div>Loading required package: RPostgreSQL Loading required package: DBI Error in value[[3L]](cond) : RS-DBI driver: (could not connect postgres@localhost on dbname &quot;postgres&quot; ) Calls: local ... tryCatch -&gt; tryCatchList -&gt; tryCatchOne -&gt; &lt;Anonymous&gt; Execution halted<div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,255,68);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:medium;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(42,42,42)\"><br></span></div>The code I am using for the connection to data source is:<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> drv </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dbDriver</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># # creates a connection to the postgres database</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> con </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dbConnect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">drv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dbname </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;postgres&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>                  host </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;localhost&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> port </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5432</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  user </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;postgres&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> password </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;xxxx&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># # query the data from postgreSQL</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> df_postgres </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dbGetQuery</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">con</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SELECT * from data&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># # close the connection</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># #dbDisconnect(con)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>on</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dbDisconnect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">con</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>Thank you in advance,<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
